":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Comments show in the right margin, attached to the text. Click one to reply."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"When a comment is handled, click Resolve (the check mark in the top corner of the comment) to close it. To see closed comments again, click Comments at the top right; Re-open brings one back."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To assign a comment, type @ and the person's name in it, check Assign to, and click Assign. The person is notified and is responsible for marking it done."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Suggesting mode"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"In Suggesting mode, your edits do not change the text. They appear as colored suggestions with your name, and the document's editors accept or reject each one. It is the Google Docs version of Word's Track Changes."}],["$","ul","1",{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary-500","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Switch modes with the mode button at the right end of the toolbar (it shows Editing): choose Suggesting. Or use View › Mode › Suggesting, or press Ctrl+Alt+Shift+X."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Type, delete, or replace text as usual. Each change becomes a suggestion card in the margin."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To accept or reject one, click the check mark or the X on its card. Tools › Review suggested edits shows them all, with Accept all and Reject all."}],["$","li","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Viewing mode shows the document without suggestions or comments, as it would print."}]]}],"$L1f"]}]]}],"$L20","$L21"]}]}]]}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"id":"practice-simulation","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px] sm:leading-[1.05]","children":"Practice Simulation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft","children":"Practice what this lesson taught in a working copy of the app. Tasks appear under the window, just like GMetrix."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-10","style":{"width":"min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))","marginLeft":"calc((100% - min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))) / 2)"},"children":[["$","$L22","gw-m3-review",{"sim":{"id":"gw-m3-review","app":"google","title":"Work through the pet policy review","scenario":"You own the draft pet policy. Denise left a comment, Marcus suggested two changes, and Priya still has to confirm the pet fee. Handle the feedback, assign the open question, and name the reviewed version so you can always get back to it.","fileName":"Pet Policy (Draft)","minutes":7,"initial":{"surface":"docs","open":"f1","tabs":["f1"],"me":{"name":"Jordan Lee","email":"jlee@parkviewpm.example","color":"#1a73e8"},"org":{"name":"Parkview Property Management","domain":"parkviewpm.example"},"people":[{"name":"Denise Carter","email":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","color":"#188038"},{"name":"Marcus Reyes","email":"mreyes@parkviewpm.example","color":"#e8710a"},{"name":"Kim Nguyen","email":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","color":"#9334e6"},{"name":"Priya Shah","email":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","color":"#d93025"},{"name":"Andre Wallace","email":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","color":"#12858a"},{"name":"Tony Russo","email":"tony@russoplumbing.example","color":"#b06000"}],"files":[{"id":"f1","name":"Pet Policy (Draft)","kind":"doc","parent":"root","modified":"9:05 AM","content":{"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1","style":"Title","text":"Pet Policy (Draft)"},{"id":"p2","text":"This policy applies to every apartment at Elm Street Apartments and Riverside Commons."},{"id":"p3","runs":[{"text":"Each apartment may have up to "},{"id":"r2","text":"two pets"},{"text":", with written approval from the office."}]},{"id":"p4","style":"Heading 1","text":"Pet Fees"},{"id":"p5","text":"A monthly pet fee applies to each pet."},{"id":"p6","style":"Heading 1","text":"Rules for Shared Spaces"},{"id":"p7","runs":[{"text":"Keep dogs on a leash in the hallways"},{"text":" and the courtyard","ins":true,"author":"Marcus Reyes"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":"p8","runs":[{"text":"Clean up after your pet. "},{"text":"Register every pet with the office.","del":true,"author":"Marcus Reyes"}]}]},"sharing":{"people":[{"email":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","role":"Commenter"},{"email":"mreyes@parkviewpm.example","role":"Commenter"},{"email":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","role":"Commenter"}]},"comments":[{"id":"c1","anchor":"p3","author":"Denise Carter","time":"8:40 AM Today","text":"Two pets seems like a lot for our one-bedroom units. Can we change it?"}],"current":{"time":"October 20, 9:05 AM","author":"Marcus Reyes"},"versions":[{"id":"v1","time":"October 12, 3:15 PM","author":"Jordan Lee","name":"First draft","content":{"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1","style":"Title","text":"Pet Policy (Draft)"},{"id":"p2","text":"This policy applies to every apartment."},{"id":"p3","text":"Each apartment may have up to two pets, with written approval from the office."}]}}]}]},"tasks":[{"instruction":"Switch to Suggesting mode.","hint":"Click the mode button at the right end of the toolbar (it shows Editing) and choose Suggesting. View › Mode › Suggesting works too.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"g.mode","value":"Suggesting"}}]},{"instruction":"Suggest changing the words “two pets” to “one pet”.","hint":"Double-click the words two pets, type one pet, and press Enter. The change shows as a suggestion in the margin.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"p3.r2","value":"one pet"}}]},{"instruction":"Reply to Denise's comment with “Suggested one pet instead.”","hint":"Click Denise's comment card in the right margin, type in the reply box, and click Reply (or press Enter).","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"reply:c1","value":"Suggested one pet instead."}}]},{"instruction":"Resolve Denise's comment.","hint":"Click Resolve, the check mark in the top corner of Denise's comment card.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"g.comment.resolve","value":"c1"}}]},{"instruction":"Comment on the heading “Pet Fees” with “@Priya Shah please confirm the monthly pet fee.” and assign it to Priya.","hint":"Click the heading Pet Fees and press Ctrl+Alt+M (or click Add comment). Type @Pri and pick Priya Shah, finish the comment, check Assign to Priya Shah, and click Assign.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"assign:pshah@parkviewpm.example","value":"@Priya Shah please confirm the monthly pet fee."},"requires":{"selection":"p4"},"selectHint":"Click the heading “Pet Fees” first, so the comment is attached to it."}]},{"instruction":"Accept Marcus's suggestion to add “and the courtyard”.","hint":"Find Marcus's suggestion (Add: and the courtyard) in the margin and click its check mark.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"review.accept"},"requires":{"selection":"p7"},"selectHint":"Click Marcus's suggestion about the courtyard in the margin first."}]},{"instruction":"Reject Marcus's suggestion to delete “Register every pet with the office.” The rule stays.","hint":"Find Marcus's suggestion (Delete: Register every pet…) in the margin and click its X.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"review.reject"},"requires":{"selection":"p8"},"selectHint":"Click Marcus's suggestion about registering pets in the margin first."}]},{"instruction":"Name the current version “Reviewed by office”.","hint":"File › Version history › Name current version. Type Reviewed by office and click Save.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"dialog","id":"g.nameVersion","values":{"name":"Reviewed by office"}},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"vername:current","value":"Reviewed by office"}]}]}]}}]]}]]}]
